und: Similar background if possible, you do not have to do the animals!\n\nThank you so much, we appreciate your consideration! <3\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/13__PGVYdjy6RGaAqDQvYqEvokLx9efTn?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sasaillust/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3bcec8cc/uploads/origins/013602cc-7818-4a91-b4c4-509988b12cc2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f2eb49863e80967991c711e11148bb9c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3bcec8cc/uploads/origins/013602cc-7818-4a91-b4c4-509988b12cc2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f2eb49863e80967991c711e11148bb9c, https://si.imgix.net/3bcec8cc/uploads/origins/013602cc-7818-4a91-b4c4-509988b12cc2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=71d898249a4fb86acdfce00ccb90619e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3bcec8cc/uploads/origins/013602cc-7818-4a91-b4c4-509988b12cc2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d403586a27f0add098709a41ae8bf9a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Your art has a very cute style to it and I would love to commission a birthday present! It is one of my best friends birthday soon and I wanted to get some cute art for him as a present!!\n\nIn order of references:\n1 - Male OC (the birthday boy) character reference\n2 - Female OC (my character)\n3 - Pose reference\n\nI think the flower crown is a really cute touch and if there's any other changes you'd like to add, like a birthday cake or presents around them on the ground, I would be okay with that! Is it okay if one version says \"Happy Birthday Yoshabie! Love, Hachiko\" and another copy doesn't have anything written? Thank you for your time!!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/N0a31Fs", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sasaillust/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/96c3f4fd/uploads/origins/bc3d603e-c999-4